    "description": "<p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>Choose a single <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>. You may <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Take_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Take 10\">Take 10</a> on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks to activate this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a> even when distracted or threatened. You may select this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Technique\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Technique\">Force Technique</a> multiple times; each time you select this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Technique\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Technique\">Force Technique</a>, it applies to a different <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Power\">Force Power</a>. </p>",
